{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Velo Pro Racer",
    "steam_appid": 3872830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velo Pro Racer\u00ae is a road cycling simulator game designed to immerse you in a professional road racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own team, design your own kit, manage your own staff and riders, get sponsors and rise to the top of the World Tour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in control of how you want to race. Want to play as the sports director? Or do you want to connect your smart trainer and ride as one of your riders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the action, and find your own way to be the first to cross the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Free to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race &amp; train online or offline for free with an optional subscription for more features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Connect to smart trainer via Bluetooth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect up your smart trainer, heart rate monitor, cadence and speed sensor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter online races or train with other riders in online free ride</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Customisable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own teams, riders, races, routes, kits and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Workouts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own workouts or select from pre-made workouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Career Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the top of the World Tour in the career mode by completing each season</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velo Pro Racer\u00ae is a road cycling simulator game designed to immerse you in a professional road racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own team, design your own kit, manage your own staff and riders, get sponsors and rise to the top of the World Tour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in control of how you want to race. Want to play as the sports director? Or do you want to connect your smart trainer and ride as one of your riders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the action, and find your own way to be the first to cross the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Free to Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race &amp; train online or offline for free with an optional subscription for more features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Connect to smart trainer via Bluetooth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect up your smart trainer, heart rate monitor, cadence and speed sensor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter online races or train with other riders in online free ride</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Customisable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own teams, riders, races, routes, kits and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Workouts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own workouts or select from pre-made workouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Career Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb to the top of the World Tour in the career mode by completing each season</p>",
    "short_description": "Velo Pro Racer\u00ae: The real road cycling simulator game designed to put you in the race. Build your own team, design your own kit, manage your own staff and riders, get sponsors and rise to the top of the World Tour!",
